# U52: "See All" (ExtBuildListControl.lua:125-136) at the bottom of the list beside the build list
# opens the active list's page (GetPageUrl): Trending first, Latest after switching tabs. Its
# position depends on the screen height, so this script runs at 1280x800 only. The draw body is
# off (PoB's behaviour): the buttons work although nothing of the list is drawn.
#! u52-setup list
#! u52-expect-effect open-url https://pobarchives.com/builds/7U8QXU8m?sort=popularity
#! u52-expect-effect open-url https://pobarchives.com/builds/yenTGNDb
screen 1280 800
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
fixture net=net.json
frames 3
move 1200 790
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 1206 69
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 1200 790
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
